B.TN=new A.aX("kanun_04",B.d3,'Malvarl\u0131\u011f\u0131na ili\u015fkin davalarda istinaf "kesinlik s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131" ne anlama gelir?',B.MH,0,"HMK m. 341: Miktar veya de\u011feri belirli bir tutar\u0131 ge\xe7meyen malvarl\u0131\u011f\u0131 davalar\u0131na ili\u015fkin kararlar kesindir (istinaf edilemez). Bu s\u0131n\u0131r her y\u0131l yeniden de\u011ferleme oran\u0131nda artar; g\xfcncel tutar\u0131 teyit et.")
